OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for eight years after
OL,4,Asex assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man convicted of sexually assaulting
OL,7,Fa woman who awoke to find him touching
OL,8,Fher without consent has been jailed for
OL,9,Feight years.
OL,11,FAmardip Dhariwal, 55, was found guilty
OL,12,Fin September of assaulting the woman at
OL,13,Fhis Bracknell home after they spent a
OL,14,Fnight socialising in May 2022.
OL,16,FHis victim pretended she was still
OL,17,Fasleep as the assault concluded,
OL,18,Ffearing how Dhariwal would react on
OL,19,Fbeing disturbed. But once it was over,
OL,20,Fshe fled, called a friend for help and
OL,21,Flater reported him to the police.
